### **Day 51-60: Capstone Project – Volyo Student Portal**  

**Topic:**  
End-to-end database design and API integration for a student portal.  

**Learning Objectives:**  
• Design a relational (SQL) or NoSQL database schema.  
• Develop backend APIs for portal functionalities.  
• Deploy and optimize database performance.  

**Activities / Deliverables:**  
• Create a database schema (MySQL/MongoDB).  
• Build APIs for student registration, course management, and analytics.  
• Deploy using Docker & AWS/GCP.  

**Important Concepts:**  
• Database normalization (SQL) vs. denormalization (NoSQL).  
• Query optimization and caching.  

**SQL Syntax / Commands:**  
• `CREATE TABLE`, `JOIN` (for SQL variant).  
• Aggregation pipelines (for MongoDB).  

**Real-world Use Cases:**  
• University management systems.  
• E-learning platforms.  

**Tools / Tech:**  
• MySQL / MongoDB.  
• Docker (Containerization).  
• Cloud Deployment (AWS/GCP).  

**Summary:**  
Developed a scalable student portal by integrating database design with API development and deployment.  

